        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Great Escape (U.S. TV series)\n- People: Rich Eisen\n- Roles: television host, television journalist\n- Organizations: NFL Network, CBS Sports, NBC Sports, DirecTV, FOX Sports Radio, Sirius Radio, NFL Now\n\nFacts:\n- Rich Eisen was born on June 24, 1969.\n- Rich Eisen is an American television journalist for NFL Network, CBS Sports, and NBC Sports.\n- Rich Eisen is a TV and radio host for DirecTV, FOX Sports Radio, Sirius Radio, and NFL Now.\n- The Great Escape is a U.S. competition television series hosted by Rich Eisen.\n- The Great Escape features three two-person teams each week.\n- The Great Escape drops the teams into the middle of their own epic action/adventure movie and has them compete for a cash prize.",
